Subject: [PATCH 078/104] Translations: everyday Japanese for solid, shape,
 geometry, face and surface
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Japanese texts of the modules used in the integrated environment
said ソリッド, シェイプ, ジオメトリー, フェイス and サーフェス; they now use
立体, 形, 図形, 面 and 曲面 like the rest of the interface.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
